  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building skills for life and work for post-conflict vulnerable youth</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will increase access to quality vocational training courses, while ensuring that youth, (ages 18-24) in post-conflict communities in Kayin State and Tanintharyi Region, are better positioned and equipped to successfully transition from learning centers to work, improving and diversifying livelihoods opportunities.</narrative>
  </description>
